OL,3,GNEWSASome parents 'unaware' summer-born
OL,4,Achildren can defer school
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome parents are unaware they can delay
OL,7,Ftheir summer-born child's school start
OL,8,Funtil age five, according to families
OL,9,Fwho have been through the process.
OL,11,FChildren born between April and August
OL,12,Fcan legally defer starting school until
OL,13,Fthe September after their fifth
OL,14,Fbirthday.
OL,16,FHowever, several parents told the BBC
OL,17,Fthey only discovered the option after
OL,18,Fresearching it themselves, citing
OL,19,Fconfusion about the rules and
OL,20,Fmisconceptions about what happens if a
OL,21,Fchild starts later.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
