OL,3,GNEWSASome parents 'unaware' summer-born
OL,4,Achildren can defer school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Education (DfE) says
OL,7,Fparents can defer their child's start
OL,8,Fdate and that requests for admission to
OL,9,Freception outside the normal age group
OL,10,Fshould be considered in the child's
OL,11,Fbest interests.
